  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Control your pod using the arrow keys or the mouse. Your drill will deploy
    automatically if you move into a diggable material beside or below you - remember,
    you cannot drill straight up.



    You can trade minerals in your storage bay
    for cold hard cash at the mineral depot, with which you will be able to purchase
    upgrads an items. Upgrades are used automatically once purchased. Use items with
    the following hot-keys:




    Press I to open Inventory

    Your inventory
    displays your items and upgrades and allows you to jettison material. If your
    pod is too heavy, click on the minerals to discard them through your exhaust
    ports.



    Press 1 to use Hull Repair Nanites

    These advanced nanobots
    will repair your hull when nowhere near a repair station.



    Press 2 to use
    Reserve Fuel Tank

    These compact bottles of compressed fuel inject straight
    into your main tank.



    Press 3 to use Dynamite

    Blasts a small area
    around your pod. Note that this also destroys valuable minerals, so be careful
    where you blast.



    Press 4 to use Plastic Explosives

    Blasts a large
    area around your pod. Note that this also destroys valuable minerals, so be careful
    where you blast.



    Press 5 to use Quantum Teleporter

    This device transforms
    your matter into energy and flings you at the surface. It isn''t always accurate,
    so remember to exercice caution.



    Press 6 to use Matter Transmitter

    A
    more stable version of the Quantum Teleporter, the Matter Transmitter is much
    safer to use. Please keep your arms and legs inside the pod at all times while
    using this device.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
